          "text": "Description: On December 24, 1978, around 9 PM, two witnesses observed a glowing object in the sky. They noted the object's slow movement and the varied colors it emitted. Around 11 PM, one of the witnesses confirmed seeing the object again, which had changed location once more. No other testimony exists to supplement these very brief statements.",
